Prospective-Boundary: no_GS_v282_target_outcome_existed_when_this_protocol_was_written
Application: gs2020
Target-Rank: 1
Upstream-Fit: exact_hash_bound_v282_q1_assembled_checkpoint
Upstream-Preflight: exact_hash_bound_v282_pre_estimation_verified_input_checkpoint
Fresh-Upstream-Requirement: v282_q1_assembly_and_preflight_generated_by_exact_parent_protocol
Prior-Target-Checkpoint-Reuse: prohibited_including_v281_partial_or_complete_checkpoints
Output-Directory: runs/gs2020/v282/prospective-2026-09-07-v1/targets
Output-Overwrite: prohibited
Checkpoint-Pair-Recovery: validate_installed_envelope_and_binding_then_recreate_only_missing_sha_sidecar
Core-Target-Selection: exactly_five_outcome_informed_post_diagnostic_manuscript_targets_in_core-target-registry.csv
Core-Target-Count: 5
Core-Family-Count: 2
Core-Families: context_preferences,heterogeneity_core
Core-Heterogeneity-Primitive-Count: 4
Core-Target-Substance: coparty_and_vote_restriction
Secondary-Directional-Table: seven_undemocratic_actions_descriptive_plugin_only_not_run_in_core_stage
Q2-Target-Selection-Role: none
Q2-Predictive-Superiority-Relevance: explicitly_irrelevant_to_target_selection
Historical-Target-Estimate-Reuse: prohibited
Riesz-Rule: target_specific_training_only_validation
Riesz-Grid: 0,Ntrain^-1,Ntrain^-3/4,Ntrain^-1/2
Riesz-Validation-Fraction: 0.20
Riesz-Tie-Rule: largest_ridge_when_absolute_risk_gap_le_1e-12_times_max_1_abs_minimum
Riesz-Numerical-Rank-Rule: dimension_epsilon
Riesz-Preconditioning: structural_Gram_whitening_plus_diagonal_congruence_equilibration_of_full_penalized_system
Riesz-Preconditioning-Estimand: unchanged
Riesz-Rank-Assessment: after_diagonal_congruence_equilibration
Riesz-Zero-Ridge-Singular-Rule: retain_frozen_cutoff_numerical_pseudoinverse_representative
Riesz-Ill-Conditioned-Positive-Ridge-Rule: withhold_never_truncate
Fast-Nuisance-Validation-Status: diagnostic_only_shared_outer_nuisance
Formal-Nuisance-Validation-Requirement: signed_inner_nuisance_refits
Riesz-Defect-Cutoff: 0.20
Riesz-Correction-Relative-Cutoff: 0.20
Ridge-Movement-Cutoff: 0.20
Analytic-Derivatives-Only: true
Derivative-Cutoff: 0.0001
Null-Space-Cutoff: 0.000001
Fit-Blockwise-KKT-Cutoff: 0.00001
Fit-Near-Optimum-Relative-Cutoff: 0.000001
Target-Near-Optimum-Selected-Movement-Cutoff-SE: 0.10
Loading-Invariance-Cutoff: 0.00000001
Loading-Rank-Tolerance: 0.00000001
Common-Family-Multiplier-Draws: 9999
Familywise-Level: 0.95
Multiplier-Distribution: independent_standard_normal_by_respondent
Multiplier-Sharing: one_common_bank_within_each_complete_core_family
Multiplier-Block-Size: 250
Target-Execution: one_target_specific_DML_call_per_registered_target
Target-Seed-Rule: family_base_seed_plus_registered_target_index
Family-Assembly: transform_target_influences_then_apply_one_common_multiplier_bank
Choice-GH-Nodes: 31
Directional-Variance-Floor: 0.000001
Subgroup-Probability-Margin: 0.05
Directional-Heterogeneity-Total-Margin: 0.0001
Crossfit-HZ-Aggregation: global_crossfit_second_moment_minus_squared_global_crossfit_mean
Crossfit-HZ-Riesz-Gradient-Center: outer_training_only
Crossfit-HZ-Support-Moments: required_global_assembly_inputs
Threshold-Change: none
Formal-Release: withheld_post_diagnostic_same_sample_and_pending_complete_gates
Confirmatory-Claim-Eligibility: independent_data_or_genuinely_pre_result_registry_or_valid_selective_inference
Formal-Release-Rule: withhold_if_any_required_fit_inference_or_target_stability_evidence_is_missing_or_fails
Current-Fast-Evidence: descriptive_and_conditional_only_even_after_numerical_gates_on_same_data_because_core_selection_was_outcome_informed
Unavailable-Target-Rule: record_explicitly_and_never_substitute_an_estimand
Whole-Repository-Cleanliness: required_for_outcome_commands
Untracked-File-Rule: reject_all_visible_untracked_files
Loaded-Package-R-Coverage: every_loaded_R_file_exactly_hashed_and_tracked
Transitive-Code-Hashing: parent_protocol_target_wrappers_and_every_package_source_on_the_target_path
RNG-Kind: L'Ecuyer-CMRG,Inversion,Rejection
Runtime-Wrapper: applications/bin/Rscript45_exact_hash
Runtime-Link-Rule: create_once_or_validate_exact_target_never_replace_during_concurrent_runs
Runtime-Binding: R_executable_sha256_R_version_platform_package_versions_native_torch_version_BLAS_and_single_thread_state
